    {
        "content": "<p>But it doesn't always work for some reason, when there's missing information, even when the expected type is known.<br>\nFor example, try removing all the <code>.symm</code>s in <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=NonUnitalAlgebra.adjoin#doc\">docs#NonUnitalAlgebra.adjoin</a> and you'll get errors (unless you fill the underscores)</p>",
